  "executive_briefing": "As of September 2026, the digital asset ecosystem stands at a structural crossroads as the Senate cloture vote on the CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633) approaches. Legislative safe harbor provisions for non-custodial smart contract infrastructure are catalyzing a wave of native Bitcoin programmability, positioning BTC script-based execution as a formidable alternative to Ethereum EVM hegemony. Concurrently, spot Bitcoin ETFs and corporate treasuries have entered an institutional maturation phase, where explosive speculative inflows are giving way to static treasury rebalancing and long-term asset consolidation. To bridge BTC and EVM ecosystems under new regulatory parameters, cross-chain infrastructure is shifting away from legacy wrapped-token models toward trust-minimized, intent-based liquidity networks.",
